@1 = ~H... hi.~
@2 = ~Hi, kid. Nice to meet you.~
@3 = ~H... hi.~
@4 = ~Hi, kid. Can you tell us what you know about the ghost sighting?~
@5 = ~Sorry to frighten you, kid. We're going.~
@6 = ~Y... yeah. He is white like snow, and old. He looked at me from the c... corner of the room. His eyes were... white, just like his skin. He was so scary. Why was he smiling like that?~
@7 = ~I wanted to scream but couldn't. I froze. I just stared at that corner and... I think I lost consciousness. Me, Mia and Tilda are the only ones who've seen it.~
@8 = ~Thanks, kid. We'll try to solve this.~
